91f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766`.\n`git diff --stat 8533c334637e8776ca7a4fe3a9fd8c6c64e35707...f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766` established a nonempty diff: **106 files changed, 83,335 insertions**. The complete pinned diff is retained in [reviewed.diff](/Users/topi/Coding/adk-field-exercises/item5-b-20260909/acceptance-pr-20260910/reviews/f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766/adversarial/mut-adversarial-f770f183-p3r4tuqp/evidence/reviewed.diff).\n\n**Right revision / Report what you reviewed, first.** `git remote -v` identified `https://github.com/topij/adk-item5-b-field-20260909.git`. The successful read-only command `git ls-remote https://github.com/topij/adk-item5-b-field-20260909.git HEAD refs/heads/main refs/heads/chore/item5-b-field-exit` returned `8533c334637e8776ca7a4fe3a9fd8c6c64e35707` for HEAD/main and `f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766` for the branch. This establishes the supplied base against the remote during this review, rather than relying on a local ancestor. Commands, outputs and statuses are in [setup.log](/Users/topi/Coding/adk-field-exercises/item5-b-20260909/acceptance-pr-20260910/reviews/f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766/adversarial/mut-adversarial-f770f183-p3r4tuqp/evidence/setup.log) and [remote-check-result.json](/Users/topi/Coding/adk-field-exercises/item5-b-20260909/acceptance-pr-20260910/reviews/f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766/adversarial/mut-adversarial-f770f183-p3r4tuqp/evidence/remote-check-result.json).\n\n**Scratch namespace / No writes in the tree you were given / Attestation.** I created a fresh namespaced directory, then ran `git clone --no-hardlinks --no-checkout /Users/topi/Coding/adk-field-exercises/item5-b-20260909/acceptance-pr-20260910/reviews/f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766/adversarial/handed-tree /Users/topi/Coding/adk-field-exercises/item5-b-20260909/acceptance-pr-20260910/reviews/f770f183bf6691f1f706c676b740cf2ef5ceb766/adversarial/mut-adversarial-f770f183-p3r4tuqp/repo` and ch